\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, and Linux</p><div class=\"bundle_row\"><div class=\"bundle_info\"><div class=\"bundle_label\">Get this game and 1 more for $7.48 USD</div><div class=\"bundle_title\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/s/195440/the-hive-161-major-update-sale\">The Hive - 1.6.1 Major Update Sale</a></div></div><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://itch.io/s/195440/the-hive-161-major-update-sale\">View bundle</a></div><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://skydome.itch.io/thehive/purchase\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><a class=\"sale_link\" href=\"https://itch.io/s/195440/the-hive-161-major-update-sale\"><div class=\"sale_label\"><div class=\"main_label\">On Sale!</div><div class=\"sub_label\"><span class=\"sale_rate\">75%</span> Off</div></div></a><span class=\"dollars original_price\">$19.99</span> <span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$4.99 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5NTIyOTcxLmdpZg==/original/h8TONZ.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></figure>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/325730/The_Hive/?utm_source=itchio&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=the_hive_base_game\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1OTYwOTQ5LnBuZw==/original/L9Z2SO.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/13677/The_Hive_Complete_Bundle?utm_source=itchio&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=the_hive_base_game\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Also available on Steam!</a><br></p>\r\n<p>The Hive is a strategy game with RPG elements where you assume command as the insectoid hivemind. Build and expand your underground colony, harvest resources, and evolve your swarm using DNA. Will you survive in this hostile yet beautiful underworld?</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyNTAzNTk0LmdpZg==/original/Qyisfd.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<h3>ABOUT THIS GAME</h3>\r\n<p>Deep beneath the surface lies a vast, ancient underworld... a realm of forgotten civilizations, colossal creatures, and untold mysteries. In <em>The Hive</em>, you command an insectoid hive mind on a journey through this hostile and beautiful landscape, driven by the instinct to survive, evolve, and uncover the secrets of a lost world.</p>\r\n<p>As your colony grows, so does your understanding of the ruins scattered across New Eden, revealing a tragic history and a glimpse of what lies beyond. This is a world where danger and beauty coexist, and every discovery could shape the fate of your swarm.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5MzY4MDY3LnBuZw==/original/Sso%2Brc.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<h3>MAIN FEATURES</h3>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5NDM2ODA4LmdpZg==/original/3d3BxV.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p><li>Assume control as the insectoid hive mind and lead your swarm to survive and thrive in a vast, ruined underworld.</li><li>Explore a beautiful yet dangerous world filled with ancient civilizations, mysterious ruins, and hostile creatures.</li><li>Build and expand your underground nest to create a thriving colony and powerful forces.</li><li>Harvest DNA from defeated enemies to unlock new units, abilities, and strategies.</li><li>Equip your creatures with powerful items scavenged from the remnants of lost civilizations.</li><li>Battle massive ancient creatures and adapt your strategy to overcome evolving challenges.</li><li>Experience an epic story that spans the hostile, yet captivating, underworld of New Eden.</li><li>Discover diverse biomes, from serene blooming springs to fiery volcanic regions, each filled with unique beauty and peril.</li><p></p><p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5NDM2ODE5LmdpZg==/original/x%2FsPHL.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_7730705\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a></td></tr><tr><td>Publisher</td><td>Skydome Entertainment</td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" data-tooltip=\"4.69 average rating from 16 total ratings\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"aggregate_rating\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" content=\"4.7\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 4.7 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 93.75000%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"